## Total

This roadmap includes **approximately 250+ widely used OSINT tools and platforms** across different investigation domains.

### Recommendation

Since you've already completed the fundamentals of your OSINT challenge, I recommend learning these tools in this order:

1. Search & Google Dorking
2. Username OSINT
3. Email OSINT
4. Phone OSINT
5. Domain & DNS
6. Website Fingerprinting
7. Social Media OSINT
8. Image & Geolocation
9. Metadata Analysis
10. Mobile OSINT
11. Browser Fingerprinting & OPSEC
12. Threat Intelligence (Shodan, Censys, GreyNoise)
13. Automation (SpiderFoot, Maltego, Recon-ng)
14. AI for OSINT
15. Reporting & Intelligence Analysis

This progression will build practical skills in the same order used by many professional OSINT analysts.
